## Computed Style Regression

### `.q-date__calendar-item` Properties

| Property                     | Baseline                 | After                    | Status   |
| ---------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------ | -------- |
| `border`                     | `1px dashed transparent` | `1px dashed transparent` | ✅ Match |
| `border-top-left-radius`     | `0` (first-in-week)      | `0`                      | ✅ Match |
| `border-bottom-left-radius`  | `0` (first-in-week)      | `0`                      | ✅ Match |
| `border-top-right-radius`    | `0` (last-in-week)       | `0`                      | ✅ Match |
| `border-bottom-right-radius` | `0` (last-in-week)       | `0`                      | ✅ Match |

### `.q-date__range` / `.q-date__range-from` / `.q-date__range-to`

| Property                     | Baseline                                   | After                             | Status   |
| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | -------- |
| `background-color`           | `rgba(var(--q-primary-rgb), 0.3)`          | `rgba(var(--q-primary-rgb), 0.3)` | ✅ Match |
| `border-top-left-radius`     | `0` (first-in-week)                        | `0`                               | ✅ Match |
| `border-bottom-left-radius`  | `0` (first-in-week)                        | `0`                               | ✅ Match |
| `border-top-right-radius`    | `0` (last-in-week)                         | `0`                               | ✅ Match |
| `border-bottom-right-radius` | `0` (last-in-week)                         | `0`                               | ✅ Match |
| `background-position`        | `left` (range-start) / `right` (range-end) | `left` / `right`                  | ✅ Match |

### `.q-date__edit-range` / `.q-date__edit-range-from` / `.q-date__edit-range-from-to`

| Property             | Baseline                     | After                        | Status   |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------- | -------- |
| `border-left`        | `2px solid var(--q-primary)` | `2px solid var(--q-primary)` | ✅ Match |
| `border-right`       | `2px solid var(--q-primary)` | `2px solid var(--q-primary)` | ✅ Match |
| `border-left-color`  | `transparent` (edit-range)   | `transparent`                | ✅ Match |
| `border-right-color` | `transparent` (edit-range)   | `transparent`                | ✅ Match |

